term":"子"},"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"永昌王健完整一段以薨諡收束，緊接子仁，襲。","evidence":[{"work_id":"w-weishu-weishou","book_id":"b-weishu-weishou-017","chapter_id":"c-weishu-weishou-017-kangzu-yongchang","source_id":"s-weishu-weishou-017-kangzu-yongchang-ws1550394","paragraph_id":"c-weishu-weishou-017-kangzu-yongchang:p002","quote":"永昌王健，泰常七年封。健姿貌魁壯，善弓馬，達兵法，所在征戰，常有大功。才藝比陳留桓王，而智略過之。從世祖破赫連昌，遂西略至木根山。討和龍，健別攻拔建德。後平叛胡白龍餘黨于西河。世祖襲蠕蠕，越涿邪山。車駕還，詔健殿後，蠕蠕萬騎追之，健與數十騎擊之，矢不虛發，所中皆應弦而斃，遂退。威震漠北。尋從平涼州，健功居多。又討破禿髮保周，自殺，傳首京師；復降沮渠無諱。無疾薨，諡曰莊王。","object_person_mention_id":"c-weishu-weishou-017-kangzu-yongchang:p002:m0003"},{"work_id":"w-weishu-weishou","book_id":"b-weishu-weishou-017","chapter_id":"c-weishu-weishou-017-kangzu-yongchang","source_id":"s-weishu-weishou-017-kangzu-yongchang-ws1550394","paragraph_id":"c-weishu-weishou-017-kangzu-yongchang:p003","quote":"子仁，襲。仁亦驍勇，有父風，世祖奇之。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-weishu-weishou-017-kangzu-yongchang:p003:m0001"}],"context":{"kind":"biographical_child_continuation","paragraph_ids":["c-weishu-weishou-017-kangzu-yongchang:p002","c-weishu-weishou-017-kangzu-yongchang:p003"],"parent_mention_id":"c-weishu-weishou-017-kangzu-yongchang:p002:m0003","child_mention_id":"c-weishu-weishou-017-kangzu-yongchang:p003:m0001","rationale":"永昌王健完整一段以薨諡收束，緊接子仁，襲。","status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false},"reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","model":null,"human_reviewed":false}],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","original_assertions_preserved":true,"unreviewed_conflicts_may_remain":true,"runtime_ai_required":false},"family_paths":[{"connection":"father","generation_distance":1,"parent_person_id":"19f_55e_8b2","source_assertion_id":"a-song050-yongchang-jian-si","evidence":[{"work_id":"w-beishi","book_id":"b-beishi-016","chapter_id":"c-beishi-016-kangzu-mingyuan","source_id":"s-beishi-016-kangzu-mingyuan-ws1518816","paragraph_id":"c-beishi-016-kangzu-mingyuan:p001","quote":"明元皇帝七男：杜密皇后生太武皇帝；大慕容夫人生樂平戾王丕；安定殤王彌闕母氏；慕容夫人生樂安宣王範；尹夫人生永昌莊王健；